      "values:originalText": "(6) Subsections (4) and (5) do not limit the matters to which regard\nmay be had in determining, for the purposes of this section, the\ndegree of power that a body corporate or bodies corporate has or\nhave in a market.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Subsections (4) and (5) do not limit the matters to which regard\nmay be had in determining, for the purposes of this section, the\ndegree of power that a body corporate or bodies corporate has or\nhave in a market.",
      "values:partOf": {
