      "skos:note": "Regard may be had in determining the degree of power that a body corporate or bodies corporate has or have in a market."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017#sch-1-sec-46-ss-6",
