      "values:originalText": "(7) To avoid doubt, for the purposes of this section, more than one\ncorporation may have a substantial degree of power in a market.",
      "skos:definition": "(7) To avoid doubt, for the purposes of this section, more than one\ncorporation may have a substantial degree of power in a market.",
