    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "46(4) Misuse of market power",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017#sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In determining for the purposes of this section the degree of power\nthat a person (the first person) or bodies corporate have in a\nmarket:\n\n(a) regard must be had to the extent to which the conduct of the\nfirst person or of any of those bodies corporate in that market\nis constrained by the conduct of:\n\n(i) competitors, or potential competitors, of the first person\nor of any of those bodies corporate in that market; or\n\n(ii) persons to whom or from whom the first person or any\nof those bodies corporate supplies or acquires goods or\nservices in that market; and\n\n(b) regard may be had to the power the first person or bodies\ncorporate have in that market that results from:\n\n(i) any contracts, arrangements or understandings that the\nfirst person or bodies corporate have with another party\nor other parties; or\n\n(ii) any proposed contracts, arrangements or understandings\nthat the first person or bodies corporate may have with\nanother party or other parties.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In determining for the purposes of this section the degree of power\nthat a person (the first person) or bodies corporate have in a\nmarket:\n\n(a) regard must be had to the extent to which the conduct of the\nfirst person or of any of those bodies corporate in that market\nis constrained by the conduct of:\n\n(i) competitors, or potential competitors, of the first person\nor of any of those bodies corporate in that market; or\n\n(ii) persons to whom or from whom the first person or any\nof those bodies corporate supplies or acquires goods or\nservices in that market; and\n\n(b) regard may be had to the power the first person or bodies\ncorporate have in that market that results from:\n\n(i) any contracts, arrangements or understandings that the\nfirst person or bodies corporate have with another party\nor other parties; or\n\n(ii) any proposed contracts, arrangements or understandings\nthat the first person or bodies corporate may have with\nanother party or other parties.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-4-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2650adbf28ba549edac8f8f254487ae27b425da7f48a8a419ba80e6aef28e24f",
      "skos:note": "Regard must be had to the extent to which conduct is constrained by competitors or suppliers."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017#sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "46(4) Misuse of market power",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In determining for the purposes of this section the degree of power\nthat a person (the first person) or bodies corporate have in a\nmarket:\n\n(a) regard must be had to the extent to which the conduct of the\nfirst person or of any of those bodies corporate in that market\nis constrained by the conduct of:\n\n(i) competitors, or potential competitors, of the first person\nor of any of those bodies corporate in that market; or\n\n(ii) persons to whom or from whom the first person or any\nof those bodies corporate supplies or acquires goods or\nservices in that market; and\n\n(b) regard may be had to the power the first person or bodies\ncorporate have in that market that results from:\n\n(i) any contracts, arrangements or understandings that the\nfirst person or bodies corporate have with another party\nor other parties; or\n\n(ii) any proposed contracts, arrangements or understandings\nthat the first person or bodies corporate may have with\nanother party or other parties."
    },
