      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(6) Subsections (4) and (5) do not limit the matters to which regard\nmay be had in determining, for the purposes of this section, the\ndegree of power that a person or bodies corporate have in a market.\n\nMisuse of market power  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 87, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act",
      "skos:definition": "(6) Subsections (4) and (5) do not limit the matters to which regard\nmay be had in determining, for the purposes of this section, the\ndegree of power that a person or bodies corporate have in a market.\n\nMisuse of market power  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 87, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act",
