      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e97aaa1efc89435063f26270b4bfacc8e202ba8976adda3079b98008e6463c4c",
      "skos:note": "No misuse of market power in determining the degree of power that a person or bodies corporate have in a market."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017#sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "46(6) Misuse of market power",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(6) Subsections (4) and (5) do not limit the matters to which regard\nmay be had in determining, for the purposes of this section, the\ndegree of power that a person or bodies corporate have in a market.\n\nMisuse of market power  Schedule 1\n\nNo. 87, 2017\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act"
    },
