    {
      "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "46(8) Misuse of market power",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017#sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017.pdf, p.9",
      "values:originalText": "(8) In this section:\n\n(a) a reference to power is a reference to market power; and\n\n(b) a reference to a market is a reference to a market for goods or\nservices; and\n\n(c) a reference to power in relation to, or to conduct in, a market\nis a reference to power, or to conduct, in that market either as\na supplier or as an acquirer of goods or services in that\nmarket.\n\n\nSchedule 2  Telecommunications industry\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act\nNo. 87, 2017",
      "skos:definition": "(8) In this section:\n\n(a) a reference to power is a reference to market power; and\n\n(b) a reference to a market is a reference to a market for goods or\nservices; and\n\n(c) a reference to power in relation to, or to conduct in, a market\nis a reference to power, or to conduct, in that market either as\na supplier or as an acquirer of goods or services in that\nmarket.\n\n\nSchedule 2  Telecommunications industry\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act\nNo. 87, 2017",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017-sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-8-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b72c69fb61bd58569248be96d3c946269fd71cdf6011f7c7c9dd358dc68156d6",
      "skos:note": "Definition of market power and its relation to conduct in a market."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/competition-and-consumer-amendment-misuse-of-market-power-act-2017#sch-1-sec-46-2-ss-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "46(8) Misuse of market power",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 9,
      "values:originalText": "(8) In this section:\n\n(a) a reference to power is a reference to market power; and\n\n(b) a reference to a market is a reference to a market for goods or\nservices; and\n\n(c) a reference to power in relation to, or to conduct in, a market\nis a reference to power, or to conduct, in that market either as\na supplier or as an acquirer of goods or services in that\nmarket.\n\n\nSchedule 2  Telecommunications industry\n\nCompetition and Consumer Amendment (Misuse of Market Power) Act\nNo. 87, 2017"
    },
